@startuml F5.19-ERRO-03-titulo-invalido
title F5.19-ERRO-03 — 422 título inválido
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "TaskController" as Ctrl

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar título vazio
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /tasks
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
note right of Ctrl
  @NotBlank / @Size(max=200)
end note
Ctrl --> WebApp: 422
WebApp --> Sec: erro inline

@enduml
